{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:45 2026-07-02 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:45 2026-07-02 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:45 2026-07-02 HKT</p><p>今日（7月2日）早上9時39分，警方接報指尖沙咀金巴利道39號賓館內，一名男子暈倒沒有反應。人員到場後，發現年約40歲的事主已經死亡。警方正調查死者身份及事件原因。</p><img alt=\"男子在賓館內猝死。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/3f594f44d62d99550432e3cb5ba085f0/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-02_at_10_37_28.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c776943fd7f66a69dde7e310716316eb/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-02_at_10_37_27_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/6d615bf64fc67be9f45f759d065f34a9/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-02_at_10_37_27.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8f23ac5627ad9c754f7ac03d61de7ba3/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-02_at_10_37_26.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/27253e805de12299b926365b651699cb/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-02_at_10_47_29.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-02T03:19:47.189389+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}